# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Root .gitignore — global safety net for the engineering-lead workbench.
# Per-project ignores live in demo/, frontend/RNModule/, microservices/.
# This file covers OS/editor cruft, secrets, and belt-and-suspenders catch-alls
# so build output or dependencies can never leak into the portfolio repo.
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------

# OS cruft
.DS_Store
.DS_Store?
._*
.Spotlight-V100
.Trashes
ehthumbs.db
Thumbs.db

# Editor / IDE
.idea/
.vscode/*
!.vscode/extensions.json
*.swp
*.swo
*~

# Secrets & local env (never commit real keys)
.env
.env.*
!.env.example

# Claude Code local overrides (keep shared settings.json, ignore local)
.claude/settings.local.json

# Dependencies (catch-all; subprojects also ignore their own)
**/node_modules/
**/vendor/

# Build / cache output (catch-all)
**/.next/
**/dist/
**/build/
**/bin/
**/obj/
*.tsbuildinfo

# Logs
*.log
npm-debug.log*
yarn-error.log*
